      "events": {
        "16": {
          "name": "EV016 (brock-rematch at x:63,y:7)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {
                "switch1_id": 12,
                "switch2_id": 14
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Hello, \\PN. The view of",
                    "Mt. Moon from here is",
                    "something, isn't it?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I come out here to study",
                    "the rock formations when",
                    "I have some free time."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I still remember our first",
                    "battle. You were just",
                    "starting out, but I could",
                    "see the determination in",
                    "your eyes."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 11,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You've grown incredibly",
                    "strong since then."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 13,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Meet me at the Battle",
                    "Arena in Vermillion City",
                    "if you want a rematch.",
                    "I'll be waiting!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "27": {
          "name": "EV027 (oak assistant -- HA outbreak at x:6,y:11)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {
                "switch1_id": 4
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 8,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 19,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It's me, Prof. Oak's",
                    "research assistant!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 21,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I was collecting field data",
                    "nearby and came across",
                    "something remarkable. You",
                    "have to see this!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 59,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It seems like there's an",
                    "outbreak of wild Pok\u00e9mon",
                    "with <b>Hidden Abilities</b>",
                    "on this route!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 65,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I spotted one of them in",
                    "this very patch of grass!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 69,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You'll be able to tell at",
                    "the start of battle if a",
                    "Pok\u00e9mon has its hidden",
                    "ability."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 75,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "This is a very rare event.",
                    "Prof. Oak thinks Hidden",
                    "Abilities may be linked to",
                    "natural fusion potential.",
                    "We're still studying it!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 78,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But I don't expect it to",
                    "last very long, so try to",
                    "catch one of these rare",
                    "Pok\u00e9mon while you still",
                    "have the chance!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 83,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I'm headed to Cerulean",
                    "City for more fieldwork,",
                    "so I'd better get moving."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 86,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It's just on the other",
                    "side of Mt. Moon. Maybe",
                    "I'll see you there. Good",
                    "luck with your League",
                    "challenge!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "26": {
          "name": "EV026 (Blocking girl at x:70,y:7)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
