              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "29": {
          "name": "EV029 (Nurse/Geodude scene at x:70,y:8)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {
                "switch1_id": 4
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "A group of thugs has been",
                    "attacking trainers inside",
                    "Mt. Moon. The Pok\u00e9mon",
                    "Center is overwhelmed!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "This poor Geodude took",
                    "the worst of it. They",
                    "didn't hold back at all."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 8,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I'm treating him as best",
                    "I can, but there are more",
                    "injured Pok\u00e9mon waiting",
                    "inside..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 14,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Nurse! I came as fast",
                    "as I could!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 50,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Thank you for coming,",
                    "Brock. This Geodude's",
                    "injuries are serious."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 56,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You might be able to",
                    "treat it better than I",
                    "can. You're the Rock",
                    "Pok\u00e9mon expert!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 59,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Of course. I'll see what",
                    "I can do."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 61,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "A group of thugs attacking",
                    "trainers... This isn't",
                    "ordinary trouble."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 67,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN, I'm glad you're",
                    "here too. You came at",
                    "just the right time."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 70,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I'll be treating this",
                    "Geodude for now, but",
                    "someone needs to find out",
                    "who's behind these attacks",
                    "and what they're after."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 74,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Knowing your skill in",
                    "battle, I can't think of",
                    "anyone better suited for",
                    "this than you."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 78,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I'd better get back to",
                    "the Pok\u00e9mon Center too.",
                    "A lot of Pok\u00e9mon are",
                    "waiting for me!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
